---
layout: base.njk
title: Programming Languages - Awesome Bangladeshi Devs
description: Explore Bangladeshi developers categorized by their primary programming languages and technologies.
permalink: /languages/index.html
---

<div class="py-12">
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold mb-4 text-center">Browse by Language</h1>
  <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">Discover top talent in specific technology stacks from the Bangladeshi GitHub community.</p>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
    {% for lang in stats.topLanguages %}
      <a href="{{ ('/languages/' + lang.name | slugifyLang + '/') | url }}" class="group p-6 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 border dark:border-gray-700 rounded-2xl hover:shadow-xl hover:border-blue-500 transition-all">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold group-hover:text-blue-500 transition-colors">{{ lang.name }}</h2>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/30 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 rounded-full text-xs font-bold">{{ lang.count }} Devs</span>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-700 h-2 rounded-full overflow-hidden mb-2">
          <div class="bg-blue-500 h-full" style="width: {{ lang.percentage }}%"></div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">{{ lang.percentage }}% of community</p>
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800/50 p-8 rounded-3xl border dark:border-gray-700">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-center">Ecosystem Highlights</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-3xl font-black text-blue-500 mb-1">{{ stats.topLanguages[0].name }}</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">Most Popular</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-3xl font-black text-green-500 mb-1">{{ stats.topLanguages | length }}</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">Primary Tracks</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-3xl font-black text-purple-500 mb-1">{{ stats.totalUsers }}</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">Active Contributors</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
